> This worked for me on `1.1.45`! You don't have to add the api key in `auth.json`, it will ask the first time inside OpenCode and if you paste it there, it will add it for you. If you do want to add it manually it's in `~/.local/share/opencode/auth.json`

For me it is working on 1.2.17 as well. But I needed to change the API URL to `https://<RSN>.services.ai.azure.com/anthropic/v1`.
Without "**_services_**", no connection could be established.

Actually it's like below, per [schema](https://opencode.ai/config.json)

```
"skills": { "paths": ["path/to/skills"] } 
```

@diegohb, it's supposed to be additional to the built-in paths based on the schema docs.
